TITLE:: ParaEQGUI
summary:: one eq in a window of its own
categories:: Libraries>ParaEQ
related:: Classes/ParaEQ, Classes/ParaEQPanel, Classes/FxHintBar

DESCRIPTION::
A link::Classes/ParaEQPanel::, a status line saying where the eq is running, and
a link::Classes/FxHintBar:: under it. What code::eq.gui:: opens; closing it stops
the analyser and leaves the eq itself untouched.

code::
e = ParaEQ.onBus(0, 2);
e.gui;                        // or ParaEQGUI(e)
e.guiObj.close;
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
ARGUMENT:: eq
ARGUMENT:: x
ARGUMENT:: y

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: eq
METHOD:: window
METHOD:: panel
METHOD:: hints
METHOD:: front
METHOD:: close
